@startuml Sensor Readings
title Sensor Readings

actor User
participant "Mobile App" as App
participant "API Backend" as API
participant "Database" as DB

== Viewing Latest Sensor Reading ==
User -> App: View garden dashboard
App -> API: GET /api/readings/garden/{garden_id}/device-type/{type}/last
API -> DB: Query most recent reading for device type
DB -> API: Return latest reading
API -> App: Reading data with timestamp
App -> User: Display current sensor value

== Viewing Historical Data ==
User -> App: Tap "View History"
App -> User: Show date range picker
User -> App: Select start and end date
App -> API: GET /api/readings/garden/{garden_id}/device-type/{type}\n?start_time=X&end_time=Y&offset=0&limit=100
API -> DB: Query readings with filters
DB -> API: Return paginated readings
API -> App: Historical data
App -> User: Display as chart or list

== Paginating Through Readings ==
User -> App: Scroll down
App -> API: GET /api/readings/garden/{garden_id}/device-type/{type}\n?offset=100&limit=100
API -> DB: Query next page
DB -> API: Return next batch
API -> App: More readings
App -> User: Append to list

@enduml
